{"code":"071850","name":"캐스텍코리아","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1998년 전자제품 및 자동차 부품을 주물공정으로 생산하기 위해 설립되었고, 2014년 코스닥에 상장함. 중국 소주과태과기유한공사, 유럽 CASTEC EUROPE S.R.L, 베트남 CASTEC VINA CO., LTD.를 종속기업으로 보유하고 있고, 천진주원전자유한공사를 관계기업으로 보유함. 동사는 터보차저 부품, 전자 부품의 주물 제조 및 판매, 주물 기술 컨설팅, 설비 제조, 절삭 가공 등을 영위하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":1194.0,"open":1214.0,"high":1214.0,"low":1173.0,"volume":8355,"amount":9975870.0,"ret_1d":-1.6474,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":3.4338,"ret_5":-0.5,"ret_20":-3.8647,"ret_60":-11.2268,"ret_120":-19.3243,"ret_250":-27.9421,"ma20":1211.45,"ma60":1277.9833,"ma120":1368.9083,"ma200":1424.53,"close_vs_ma200":-16.1829,"close_vs_ma60":-6.5716,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-49.2499,"r2_60":0.8661,"slope_120":-41.8101,"r2_120":0.9172,"slope_250":-23.1615,"r2_250":0.8031,"high52":1907.0,"low52":1133.0,"pos_52w":7.8811,"dd_52w":-37.3886,"mdd_1y":-29.0496,"atr14_pct":4.5047,"vol_ann_60":29.4721,"vol_avg20":12249.95,"vol_ratio20":0.682,"vr5":2.1195,"vr20":1.1959,"amount_avg5":16213557.6,"amount_avg20":14900846.6,"amount_avg60":9115255.7167,"obv_chg20":2.4278,"turnover_20":1.0098,"pv_eff_20":-3.827,"rsi14":41.7973,"frgn_net_5":2666.0,"inst_net_5":417.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.011,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0017,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0127,"frgn_net_20":-2563.0,"inst_net_20":417.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0106,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0017,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0088,"frgn_net_60":-11318.0,"inst_net_60":417.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0467,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0017,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0449,"frgn_net_120":-23849.0,"inst_net_120":417.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0983,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0017,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0966,"foreign_ratio":1.67,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.02,"smart_buy_streak":3,"op_income_q":1.0,"op_margin_q":0.2299,"op_qoq":108.3333,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":null,"rev_yoy":2.1127,"op_trend_4q":21.7544,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-7.51,"debt_ratio":175.76,"per":null,"p